---
// PilotIntroVisual.astro — Formulario de solicitud de demostración
---

<div class="visual-col" data-reveal="card">
  <div id="form-piloto" class="interest-form-card">
    <form
      class="demo-form"
      id="pilot-interest-form"
      novalidate
      action="/api/pilot"
      data-endpoint="/api/pilot"
      method="POST"
    >
      <!-- Campo Honeypot invisible para protección pasiva anti-bot -->
      <input
        type="text"
        name="_gotcha"
        tabindex="-1"
        autocomplete="off"
        aria-hidden="true"
        style="position: absolute; left: -9999px; width: 1px; height: 1px; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;"
      />

      <!-- Clave de idempotencia única por sesión de formulario -->
      <input type="hidden" name="idempotency_key" id="pilot-idempotency-key" value="" />

      <div class="inputs-grid">
        <div class="input-field-wrap">
          <label for="company-name" class="input-label">Empresa</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="company-name"
            name="company"
            class="form-text-input"
            maxlength="120"
            autocomplete="organization"
            required
          />
        </div>

        <div class="input-field-wrap">
          <label for="company-email" class="input-label">Correo</label>
          <input
            type="email"
            id="company-email"
            name="email"
            class="form-text-input"
            maxlength="254"
            autocomplete="email"
            required
          />
        </div>

        <div class="input-field-wrap">
          <label for="company-phone" class="input-label">Teléfono (opcional)</label>
          <input
            type="tel"
            id="company-phone"
            name="phone"
            class="form-text-input"
            maxlength="30"
            autocomplete="tel"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="input-field-wrap">
          <label for="daily-loads" class="input-label">Cargas al día</label>
          <select id="daily-loads" name="daily_loads" class="form-text-input form-select">
            <option value="">Selecciona una opción</option>
            <option value="<20">Menos de 20</option>
            <option value="20-50">20-50</option>
            <option value="50-100">50-100</option>
            <option value=">100">Más de 100</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="input-field-wrap input-field-full">
          <label for="company-erp" class="input-label">ERP que usáis (opcional)</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="company-erp"
            name="erp"
            class="form-text-input"
            maxlength="60"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cláusula informativa de primera capa (RGPD art. 13 / LOPDGDD art. 11) -->
      <p class="privacy-box-text">
        <strong>Información de protección de datos:</strong> Responsable: Juan Alberto Martínez López. Finalidad: atender la solicitud de demostración y valorar el encaje operativo. Legitimación: medidas precontractuales a petición del interesado (art. 6.1.b RGPD) e interés legítimo en contactos profesionales (art. 19 LOPDGDD). Detalles completos en nuestra <a href="/politica-privacidad" class="privacy-link">Política de Privacidad</a>.
      </p>

      <div class="form-btn-wrap">
        <button type="submit" class="cta-button btn-submit-pilot" id="btn-submit-pilot">
          <span id="btn-pilot-text">Pedir demostración</span>
          <svg
            width="16"
            height="16"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="btn-arrow-icon"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <div id="feedback-note" class="feedback-notification hidden" role="status"></div>

    <p class="form-disclaimer">
      Sin compromiso. Te respondemos en un día laborable.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .visual-col {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .interest-form-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-canvas, var(--palette-slate-50));
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 10px);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .interest-form-card {
      padding: 2rem;
    }
  }

  .demo-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .inputs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.875rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .inputs-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .input-field-full {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  .input-field-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .input-label {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .form-text-input {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.875rem;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 6px);
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface, var(--palette-white));
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong, var(--palette-slate-300));
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .form-text-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.14);
  }

  .privacy-box-text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, var(--palette-slate-500));
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0 0;
  }

  .privacy-box-text strong {
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
  }

  .privacy-link {
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .privacy-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-brand-hover, var(--palette-emerald-800));
  }

  .form-btn-wrap {
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .btn-submit-pilot {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 6px);
    background-color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    color: var(--palette-white);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-submit-pilot:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-brand-hover, var(--palette-emerald-800));
  }

  .btn-submit-pilot:disabled {
    opacity: 0.7;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .btn-arrow-icon {
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-submit-pilot:hover .btn-arrow-icon {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .feedback-notification {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    padding: 0.875rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 6px);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .feedback-notification.is-unconfigured {
    background-color: var(--palette-amber-100);
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-amber-300);
    color: var(--palette-amber-800);
  }

  .feedback-notification.is-error {
    background-color: var(--palette-red-100);
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-red-300);
    color: #991b1b;
  }

  .feedback-notification.is-success {
    background-color: var(--palette-emerald-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-emerald-200);
    color: var(--palette-emerald-900);
  }

  .hidden {
    display: none;
  }

  .form-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, var(--palette-slate-500));
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0.875rem 0 0 0;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .form-text-input,
    .btn-submit-pilot,
    .btn-arrow-icon {
      transition: none !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
